<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8" />
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
	<title>Safety, AOPA Hub</title>
</head>
<body>

<div class="home">
	<header class="home__header" id="home-header">
		<img class="home__chrome" src="/images/aopa/home/1/chrome-100.jpg" alt="" />
		<img class="home__mini-nav" src="/images/aopa/home/1/mini-nav-100.jpg" alt="" />
	</header>

	<section class="js-hub-hero hub-hero relative overflow-hidden bg-[#0d1b2a]">
		<img
			class="js-hub-hero-bg pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 -top-[20%] h-[140%] w-full select-none object-cover will-change-transform"
			src="/images/aopa/hub/template/safety.jpg"
			alt=""
		/>
		<div
			class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(13,27,42,0.15)_0%,rgba(13,27,42,0.75)_78%,rgba(13,27,42,0.95)_100%)]"
		></div>

		<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-end justify-end overflow-hidden">
			<div class="grid">
				<span class="js-hub-hero-watermark-overlay [grid-area:1/1] translate-y-[0.2em] mix-blend-overlay font-national text-[10rem] font-bold uppercase leading-none text-white sm:text-[14rem] lg:text-[14rem]">
					Safety
				</span>
				<span class="js-hub-hero-watermark-solid [grid-area:1/1] translate-y-[0.2em] mix-blend-normal font-national text-[10rem] font-bold uppercase leading-none text-white opacity-0 sm:text-[14rem] lg:text-[14rem]">
					Safety
				</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="relative z-[1] mx-auto flex min-h-[calc(97vh-var(--chrome-h))] w-full max-w-8xl flex-col justify-end px-8 pb-20 sm:px-12 lg:px-24">
			<h1 class="mt-3 max-w-[15ch] font-national text-4xl font-medium leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-6xl">
				<span class="font-light italic">The skills</span> that bring you home.
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-4 max-w-[46ch] font-national text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-white/80 sm:text-2xl">
				Free safety education from the AOPA Air Safety Institute, for every certificated pilot, organized by the topics that matter. 
			</p>
			<div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
				<a
					href="#"
					class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#01a2e0] px-7 py-3.5 font-national text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-white no-underline"
				>
					Find a Free ASI Course
				</a>
				<a
					href="#"
					class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white px-7 py-3.5 font-national text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-[#182f56] no-underline"
				>
					View Your ASI Transcript
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>


	</section>

	

	<!-- ===== FEATURED TOOL MODULE ===== -->
	<section class="js-tool-module relative overflow-hidden bg-white px-8 py-36 sm:px-12 lg:px-24">
		<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl">
			<div class="js-reveal mb-14 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-8">
				<h2 class="max-w-[20ch] font-national text-3xl font-medium text-[#182f56] sm:text-4xl">
					<span class="font-light italic">Explore Safety</span> by area
				</h2>
			</div>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate col-span-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-[#182f56] no-underline sm:flex-row sm:h-[22rem]">
					<div class="relative h-48 w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden sm:h-full sm:w-2/5">
						<img
							src="/images/aopa/home/4/plane-clouds-100.jpg"
							alt=""
							class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full select-none object-cover"
						/>
					</div>
					<div class="relative flex flex-1 flex-col justify-center max-w-[40rem] gap-3 p-7">
						<div>
							<span class="font-national text-2xl font-medium text-[#7ce0ff]">Air Safety Institute</span>
							<p class="mt-2 font-national text-xl font-light text-white">
								Hundreds of free interactive courses, videos and quizzes, with everything you complete tracked on your ASI transcript.
							</p>
						</div>
						<span class="font-national text-xl font-light italic text-white/80">
							Since 1950, the world's largest provider of free general aviation safety content — funded by donations to the AOPA Foundation.
						</span>
						<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Air Safety Institute →</span>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#182f56] p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="block font-national text-xl font-medium text-[#7ce0ff]">Flight Operations</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-white">
							Every phase of flight, from fuel and runway safety to collision avoidance, IFR, backcountry and emergencies.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="relative font-national text-base font-light italic text-white/90">
						More than three accidents a week result from fuel exhaustion, starvation or contamination. — ASI Fuel Management
					</span>
					<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Flight Operations →</span>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#182f56] p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="block font-national text-xl font-medium text-[#7ce0ff]">Weather</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-white">
							Weather judgment before and during the flight, from fronts and icing to VFR into IMC and pilot reports.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="relative font-national text-base font-light italic text-white/90">
						"Forecasts are educated guesses, not guarantees." — ASI Weather Wise
					</span>
					<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Weather →</span>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#182f56] p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="block font-national text-xl font-medium text-[#7ce0ff]">Human Factors</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-white">
							Decision-making, personal minimums, fitness to fly, fatigue, aging and mental health.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="relative font-national text-base font-light italic text-white/90">
						About 75 percent of all aircraft accidents are caused by pilot error. — NTSB, via ASI Do the Right Thing
					</span>
					<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Human Factors →</span>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#182f56] p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="font-national text-xl font-medium text-[#7ce0ff]">Accident Analysis</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-white">
							The Richard G. McSpadden Report and ASI's special reports: what actually goes wrong, and why.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="relative font-national text-base font-light italic text-white/90">
						Night flying is 7 percent of GA accidents but 16 percent of fatal ones. — ASI Night Flying Accident Report
					</span>
					<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Accident Analysis →</span>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#182f56] p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="font-national text-xl font-medium text-[#7ce0ff]">Aircraft Systems and Avionics</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-white">
							How engines, props and pneumatics work and fail, and what to know when stepping up to a new aircraft.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="relative font-national text-base font-light italic text-white/90">
						"The root cause of mechanically induced accidents is almost always neglect." — ASI Propeller Safety
					</span>
					<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Aircraft Systems and Avionics →</span>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#182f56] p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="block font-national text-xl font-medium text-[#7ce0ff]">Flight School Resources</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-white">
							The peer network, newsletter, business resources and safety-culture tools for the people who teach.
						</p>
						<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Flight School Resources →</span>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>


	<!-- ===== PROOF (STATS) + AOPA IN ACTION ===== -->
	<section class="js-hub-advocacy relative overflow-hidden bg-[#1d3f6d] px-8 py-36 sm:px-12 lg:px-24">
		<img
			class="js-hub-advocacy-bg pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 -top-[100%] h-[300%] w-full select-none object-cover will-change-transform"
			src="/images/aopa/home/4/sky-portrait.jpg"
			alt=""
		/>
		<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[#1d3f6d]/55"></div>

		<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl">
			<h2 class="js-reveal mb-14 max-w-[26ch] font-national text-3xl font-medium text-white sm:text-4xl">
				Seventy-five years of making general aviation safer
			</h2>

			<div class="js-reveal mb-20 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
				<a href="#" class="no-underline">
					<div class="font-national text-5xl font-bold text-[#7ce0ff]">1950</div>
					<p class="mt-3 font-national text-lg font-medium text-white">
						the year ASI began building a safer culture for general aviation
					</p>
					<p class="mt-2 font-national text-sm font-light text-white/60">
						Funded by donations to the AOPA Foundation; its education is free to every pilot.
					</p>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="no-underline">
					<div class="font-national text-5xl font-bold text-[#7ce0ff]">~50%</div>
					<p class="mt-3 font-national text-lg font-medium text-white">
						reduction in the fatal flight training accident rate over 20 years
					</p>
					<p class="mt-2 font-national text-sm font-light text-white/60">
						ASI Fatal Flight Training Accident Report, executive summary.
					</p>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="no-underline">
					<div class="font-national text-5xl font-bold text-[#7ce0ff]">Six carriers</div>
					<p class="mt-3 font-national text-lg font-medium text-white">
						waive part or all of a deductible for qualifying ASI education
					</p>
					<p class="mt-2 font-national text-sm font-light text-white/60">
						Completed within six months before an accident; terms live on the ASI page, not here.
					</p>
				</a>
			</div>

			<div class="js-reveal grid gap-10 rounded-lg bg-[#0d1b2a]/50 p-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
				<div>
					<div class="mb-3 font-national font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#7ce0ff]">
						AOPA in Action
					</div>
					<h3 class="max-w-[26ch] font-national text-2xl font-medium text-white">
						The National Pause for General Aviation Safety
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-4 max-w-[52ch] font-national font-light leading-relaxed text-white/90">
						In 2025 AOPA brought 21 aviation organizations and the FAA Safety Team together for the
						National Pause for General Aviation Safety, a six-month campaign pointing every pilot to
						free safety education that earns FAA WINGS credit. The fatal accident rate is down 60
						percent since 1994, and the work is to keep it falling.
					</p>
					<a
						href="#"
						class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-national text-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#7ce0ff] no-underline"
					>
						See how AOPA leads the fight for safer skies
					</a>
					<p class="mt-4 font-national text-sm font-light text-white/50">
						Source: AOPA news release, April 1, 2025
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="js-hub-advocacy-photo relative min-h-[280px] overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
					<img
						src="/images/aopa/home/4/advocacy/c182-flying.jpg"
						alt=""
						class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full select-none object-cover"
					/>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ===== MEMBER BENEFIT ===== -->
	<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white">
		<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2">
			<div class="js-reveal flex flex-col justify-center gap-6 px-8 py-16 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 xl:pl-24">
				<div class="mx-auto w-fit">
					<h3 class="max-w-[26ch] font-national text-4xl font-medium text-[#182f56]">
						<span class="font-light italic">The education is free</span> to every pilot. Membership
						is what keeps it coming.
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 max-w-[44ch] font-national text-2xl font-light text-gray-500 mb-8">
						Accident Forgiveness credit for the courses you complete, your ASI transcript, and the
						tools around them.
					</p>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
						<a
							href="#"
							class="js-learn-more-4 js-plane-runway-btn relative mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-7 rounded-full bg-[#182f56] py-2 pl-10 pr-2 no-underline"
						>
							<span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full" aria-hidden="true">
								<span
									class="js-learn-more-4-flair pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 origin-top-left scale-0 will-change-transform"
									aria-hidden="true"
								>
									<span class="absolute left-0 top-0 aspect-square w-[260%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#5b9bd5] opacity-40"></span>
								</span>
							</span>
							<span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
								<span class="js-plane-runway-icon absolute left-6 top-[-4px] grid h-6 w-6 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center text-[#5b9bd5] opacity-0">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="currentColor" class="h-full w-full">
										<path d="M30.79,10.85l-2.33-2.99v-.02c-1.57-1.92-4.3-2.4-6.42-1.14l-6.45,3.85-6.74-2.48c-.23-.08-.47-.08-.7,0l-.9.34-.04.02c-1.02.44-1.48,1.61-1.05,2.63.11.26.28.49.48.68l2.73,2.65-2.52,1.52-3.53-1.19c-.25-.08-.52-.07-.76.05l-.38.18c-1.01.45-1.46,1.63-1.01,2.64.11.24.26.45.45.63l4.5,4.41h.01c.92.89,2.14,1.37,3.41,1.37.89,0,1.76-.24,2.53-.69l18.43-11c.47-.28.63-.9.35-1.37-.02-.04-.04-.07-.07-.1h0Z" />
									</svg>
								</span>
							</span>
							<span class="js-learn-more-4-label relative font-national font-medium  uppercase tracking-widest text-white">
								Join AOPA
							</span>
							<span
								class="js-learn-more-4-icon relative grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white text-[#182f56]"
								aria-hidden="true"
							>
								<svg class="js-learn-more-4-arrow h-8 w-8 rotate-45" viewBox="0 0 41.69 43.1" fill="none">
									<polygon
										fill="currentColor"
										points="30.75 21.39 27.61 18.25 24.66 15.09 24.85 17.26 24.83 43.05 16.76 43.1 16.77 17.45 16.82 15.38 12.56 19.77 0 32.33 0 20.83 5.47 15.32 8.82 12 12.8 7.99 20.87 0 41.68 20.8 41.69 32.33 38.04 28.68 30.75 21.39"
									/>
								</svg>
							</span>
						</a>
						<a
							href="#"
							class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#182f56]/20 px-7 py-3.5 font-national text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-[#182f56] no-underline"
						>
							Find a Free ASI Course
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="js-member-frame relative min-h-[70vh] overflow-hidden">
				<img
					src="/images/aopa/hub/template/two-pilots.jpg"
					alt=""
					class="js-member-bg pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 -top-[20%] h-[140%] w-full select-none object-cover will-change-transform"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ===== FAQ + ELSEWHERE + PROVENANCE ===== -->
	<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#f2f2f2] px-8 py-24 sm:px-12 lg:px-24">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr]">
			<div class="js-reveal">
				<h2 class="mb-8 font-national text-3xl font-medium text-[#182f56]">
					<span class="font-light italic">Questions</span> Pilots Ask
				</h2>

				<div class="js-faq border-t border-[#182f56]/10">
				<div class="js-faq-item is-open border-b border-[#182f56]/10">
					<button type="button" class="js-faq-q flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-xl font-national text-base font-bold text-[#182f56]">
						What is the AOPA Air Safety Institute, and is it free?
						<span class="js-faq-plus font-national text-xl font-light text-[#01a2e0]">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="js-faq-a overflow-hidden">
						<p class="mb-5 font-national text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
							The Air Safety Institute is AOPA's nonprofit safety education arm, funded by
							donations to the AOPA Foundation. Every course, video and quiz is free to any
							pilot, member or not.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="js-faq-item border-b border-[#182f56]/10">
					<button type="button" class="js-faq-q flex w-full text-xl items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-national text-base font-bold text-[#182f56]">
						Which AOPA safety courses earn FAA WINGS credit?
						<span class="js-faq-plus font-national text-xl font-light text-[#01a2e0]">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="js-faq-a overflow-hidden">
						<p class="mb-5 font-national text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
							Most ASI online courses and many videos count toward the FAA WINGS Pilot
							Proficiency Program. Completed activities post automatically to your WINGS
							record.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="js-faq-item border-b border-[#182f56]/10">
					<button type="button" class="js-faq-q flex w-full items text-xl items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-national  font-bold text-[#182f56]">
						Which ASI courses count toward AOPA Accident Forgiveness?
						<span class="js-faq-plus font-national text-xl font-light text-[#01a2e0]">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="js-faq-a overflow-hidden">
						<p class="mb-5 font-national text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
							One online course, one live webinar, two Accident Case Study videos, three
							quizzes, the eFIRC, or all of the Avoiding Common Damage Causes videos —
							completed within six months before an accident.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="js-faq-item border-b border-[#182f56]/10">
					<button type="button" class="js-faq-q flex w-full items text-xl items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-national  font-bold text-[#182f56]">
						Where do I find my ASI transcript?
						<span class="js-faq-plus font-national text-xl font-light text-[#01a2e0]">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="js-faq-a overflow-hidden">
						<p class="mb-5 font-national text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
							Every course, quiz and video you complete is tracked automatically on your ASI
							transcript, viewable anytime from your My AOPA account.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			</div>

			<div class="js-reveal flex flex-col gap-10">
				<div>
					<p class="font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#182f56]">
						More from Safety
					</p>
					<ul class="mt-4 list-none space-y-2 p-0 font-national text-lg text-[#182f56]">
						<li><a href="#" class="text-[#182f56] no-underline hover:text-[#01a2e0]">Online Courses</a></li>
						<li><a href="#" class="text-[#182f56] no-underline hover:text-[#01a2e0]">Safety Quizzes</a></li>
						<li><a href="#" class="text-[#182f56] no-underline hover:text-[#01a2e0]">ASI Videos</a></li>
						<li><a href="#" class="text-[#182f56] no-underline hover:text-[#01a2e0]">Real Pilot Stories</a></li>
						<li><a href="#" class="text-[#182f56] no-underline hover:text-[#01a2e0]">Safety Insider Newsletter</a></li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div>
					<p class="font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#182f56]">
						Elsewhere on aopa.org
					</p>
					<ul class="mt-4 list-none space-y-2 p-0 font-national text-lg text-[#182f56]">
						<li><a href="#" class="text-[#182f56] no-underline hover:text-[#01a2e0]">Go Fly → Stay Current</a></li>
						<li><a href="#" class="text-[#182f56] no-underline hover:text-[#01a2e0]">Advocacy → Airmen</a></li>
						<li><a href="#" class="text-[#182f56] no-underline hover:text-[#01a2e0]">Get Involved → AOPA Foundation</a></li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<p class="border-t border-[#182f56]/10 pt-6 font-national text-sm font-light text-gray-500">
					Reviewed by the AOPA Air Safety Institute (reviewers named) · Last updated [DATE]
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>



	<footer class="relative z-[1] bg-[#182f56] px-8 py-16 sm:px-12 lg:px-24">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
